 184:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****      (#) Function @ref HAL_DCMIPP_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 185:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****          (+) ErrorCallback          : callback for Error
 186:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****          (+) MspInitCallback        : DCMIPP MspInit.
 187:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****          (+) MspDeInitCallback      : DCMIPP MspDeInit.
 188:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****           This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 189:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****           and a pointer to the user callback function.
 190:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****      (#) Function @ref HAL_DCMIPP_PIPE_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
