 192:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****          (+) PIPE_VsyncEventCallback : callback for Pipe Vsync Event.
 193:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****          (+) PIPE_LineEventCallback  : callback for Pipe Line Event.
 194:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****          (+) PIPE_LimitEventCallback : callback for Pipe Limit Event.
 195:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****          (+) PIPE_ErrorCallback      : callback for Pipe Error
 196:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dcmipp.c ****           This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
